---
title: "transfer_obligation_key (Scallop Lend: Borrowing)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate_owner: verify sender owns obligation_key
    q_validate_owner --> q_error: sender != obligation_key.owner
    q_validate_owner --> q_transfer: sender == obligation_key.owner
    q_error --> [*]: revert "not owner"
    q_transfer --> q_update: obligation_key.owner = recipient_address
    q_update --> [*]: return success

    note right of q_transfer
        INV-001: Transferring ObligationKey transfers full control of the Obligation
        INV-002: Recipient gains ability to deposit, withdraw, borrow, and repay
        INV-003: No approval needed for transfers between sub-accounts of same owner
        INV-004: Collateral and debt move with the Obligation (not with the key transfer)
    end note
